<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Portrait of a Blank Slate</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lovejoy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Wake Up &amp; It's Over</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7505qe0xzCuDPaILCURnOC</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.960" end="00:28.033">They told me that much and now he's dead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.033" end="00:30.273">Told me to kill my indulgences</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.273" end="00:33.071">With a sharp blow, to the temple</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.071" end="00:36.152">Pick up the phone call and do everything he says</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.152" end="00:39.241">I could take a, plastic camera</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.241" end="00:42.080">We could make such a, pretty picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.080" end="00:44.881">Oh so happy, oh oh so happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.881" end="00:47.954">l'm pretty cool once you get to know me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.954" end="00:49.454" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.072" end="00:51.869">I feel at some point I broke my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.869" end="00:54.097">l'm always searching the silent type</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.097" end="00:56.893">How do you all make it look so easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.893" end="01:00.244">You open your arms up so quickly it scares me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.244" end="01:03.039">She's an artist, paints across my chest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.039" end="01:06.128">Goes to parties, act like hotel guests</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.128" end="01:09.212">Wake up Monday, now it's over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.212" end="01:12.514">Don't you know no one gets what they came here for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.514" end="01:15.032">I could paint her, wrap around her,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.032" end="01:18.104">We could make such a, pretty picture</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.104" end="01:20.693">Oh so happy, oh oh so happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.693" end="01:23.792">l'm pretty cool once you get to know me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.792" end="01:26.034" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.034" end="01:33.013">But I'm just the same, I've got a boring name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.013" end="01:37.787">Across the world from what you want and what you came here for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.787" end="01:40.343">It looks like im waiting for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.343" end="01:46.312">So please just let me stay, oh just let me stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.312" end="01:52.179" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.179" end="01:54.969">I guess you now know what to expect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.969" end="01:57.212">He lives your own life in retrospect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.212" end="02:00.019">You know what bores me, his insecurity</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.019" end="02:03.098">He breaks you down just to act as the architect</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.098" end="02:06.173">I could wait here, by the west pier</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.173" end="02:08.974">Watch the flotsam float slowly disappear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.974" end="02:11.765">Oh so happy, oh oh so happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.765" end="02:15.157">lf only you knew just how much better things could be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.157" end="02:23.157" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.848" end="02:35.555">Another week of action</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.555" end="02:38.070">Another hypoglycemic reaction</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.070" end="02:46.070" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.201" end="02:59.912">But I'm just the same, I've got a boring name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.912" end="03:04.666">Across the world from what you want and what you came here for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.666" end="03:07.191">It looks like I'm waiting for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.191" end="03:13.620">So please just let me stay, oh just let me stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.620" end="03:15.120">or just let me!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.017" end="03:23.017" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.364" end="03:32.364">Sorry it's all so predictable</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.022" end="03:40.022">Sorry it's all so predicable, I made</p></div></body></tt>